<title>UK: Vaux to sell Andrews Homes for 43.2 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Vaux to sell Andrews Homes for 43.2 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>British brewers and hotels Group Vaux Group Plc said on Thursday it would sell its St Andrews Homes Ltd for 43.2 million stg to Highfield Group Ltd, a care home group based in Edinburgh.</p>
</text>
